            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuiwike Ndima ya Mikate Isewadie Chachu. Na seji nerekulaghirieghe, Kuseje mkate ghuko na chachu kwa matuku mfungade gha mori ghwa Abibu, angu ugho nigho mori korefumieghe Misri.",
          "type": "text",
